<view class="page with-dock"><view class="notice">完整资料需包含作者 / 导演、简介、图片与来源。未补齐可先保存为待补全。</view><picker range="{{kinds}}" value="{{kindIndex}}" bindchange="kind" disabled="{{form.id}}"><view class="picker">{{kinds[kindIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="label">作品名称</view><input class="field" value="{{form.title}}" data-field="form.title" bindinput="input" maxlength="200"/><view class="label">作者 / 导演</view><input class="field" value="{{form.creator}}" data-field="form.creator" bindinput="input" maxlength="300"/><view class="label">年份 / 出版日期</view><input class="field" value="{{form.year}}" data-field="form.year" bindinput="input" maxlength="40"/><view class="label">简介</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{form.description}}" data-field="form.description" bindinput="input" maxlength="12000"/><view class="label">图片 HTTPS 地址</view><input class="field" value="{{form.image}}" data-field="form.image" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/><view class="label">原始来源 HTTPS 链接</view><input class="field" value="{{form.source_url}}" data-field="form.source_url" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000"/><view class="check"><switch checked="{{confirmed}}" bindchange="confirm" color="#252525"/><text>已确认资料与图片匹配</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view><view class="dock"><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存作品</button></view>
